{"lines": ["How is Benito Mussolini connected to Mario?", "In nineteen forty-one, Mussolini met Spain's dictator Francisco Franco on the Italian Riviera, pressing him to join the war.", "Spain stayed out, and in nineteen seventy-two Franco received California's governor, Ronald Reagan, in Madrid.", "In nineteen eighty-four, President Reagan met Arnold Schwarzenegger, fresh from The Terminator, at the Republican convention.", "In twenty twenty-five, Arnold brought his son-in-law, Chris Pratt, to the premiere of his show FUBAR.", "And in twenty twenty-three, Chris Pratt became the voice of Mario in the Super Mario Bros Movie.", "How is Queen Elizabeth the Second connected to Freddy Fazbear?", "In two thousand nine, Queen Elizabeth the Second welcomed Barack Obama to Buckingham Palace.", "In twenty fifteen, Obama was a guest on Jimmy Kimmel's late-night show.", "In twenty eighteen, Kimmel shared a Los Angeles stage with fellow host Conan O'Brien.", "At Comic-Con twenty fifteen, Conan hosted a Hunger Games panel with Josh Hutcherson.", "And in twenty twenty-three, Hutcherson played the night guard hunted by Freddy Fazbear in the Five Nights at Freddy's movie.", "How is Napoleon connected to Pikachu?", "In eighteen oh-four, Napoleon crowned himself emperor, and France's line of rulers runs from him to Emmanuel Macron.", "In twenty twenty-three, Macron hosted King Charles the Third at a state dinner in the Palace of Versailles.", "In twenty twenty-two, Ryan Reynolds showed the King around Wrexham, the Welsh football club he co-owns.", "And in twenty nineteen, Reynolds became the voice of Pikachu in the movie Detective Pikachu.", "How is Qin Shi Huang connected to Kevin Hart?", "Qin Shi Huang invented the title of emperor, and China's emperors held it for 2,000 years, down to the last one.", "In nineteen forty, China's last emperor, by then Japan's puppet ruler in Manchuria, shook hands with Emperor Hirohito.", "In nineteen seventy-five, Hirohito made the first state visit to America by a Japanese emperor, hosted by Gerald Ford.", "In nineteen ninety-seven, Ford shared a stage with President Bill Clinton at a presidential library opening in Texas.", "In twenty thirteen, Barack Obama hung the Presidential Medal of Freedom around Clinton's neck.", "In January twenty seventeen, Obama's defense secretary Ash Carter gave him the Pentagon's medal for distinguished public service.", "And in twenty sixteen, Carter met Kevin Hart backstage at a Late Night with Seth Meyers taping in Washington.", "How is Genghis Khan connected to SpongeBob SquarePants?", "Genghis Khan founded the Mongol Empire, and his grandson Kublai became its fifth Great Khan.", "A 15th-century French manuscript painted Kublai Khan receiving the Venetian merchant brothers Niccol\u00f2 and Maffeo Polo.", "The same book paints the Polos with Pope Gregory the Tenth, who sent them back to Kublai in twelve seventy-one.", "From Gregory the Tenth, the 184th pope, the line runs unbroken to the 266th, Pope Francis.", "In twenty fifteen, Barack and Michelle Obama welcomed Pope Francis to the White House.", "And in twenty twelve in London, Michelle Obama kicked a goal past SpongeBob, with David Beckham cheering."], "heard": [["How", 0.0, 0.34], ["is", 0.34, 0.46], ["Benito", 0.46, 0.88], ["Mussolini", 0.88, 1.42], ["connected", 1.42, 1.96], ["to", 1.96, 2.28], ["Mario?", 2.28, 2.64], ["In", 3.46, 3.5], ["1941,", 3.5, 3.96], ["Mussolini", 4.52, 4.98], ["met", 4.98, 5.26], ["Spain's", 5.26, 5.62], ["dictator", 5.62, 5.96], ["Francisco", 5.96, 6.48], ["Franco", 6.48, 6.78], ["on", 6.78, 7.36], ["the", 7.36, 7.44], ["Italian", 7.44, 7.74], ["Riviera,", 7.74, 8.38], ["pressing", 8.64, 8.92], ["him", 8.92, 9.24], ["to", 9.24, 9.36], ["join", 9.36, 9.54], ["the", 9.54, 9.66], ["war.", 9.66, 9.86], ["Spain", 10.44, 10.68], ["stayed", 10.68, 10.84], ["out.", 10.84, 11.1], ["And", 11.72, 11.72], ["in", 11.72, 11.8], ["1972,", 11.8, 12.46], ["Franco", 12.52, 13.0], ["received", 13.0, 13.4], ["Ca